[{"name":"v0.2.0","tag_name":"v0.2.0","description":"- The following items are now shuffled:\n  - Kakariko Village Street Merchant items\n  - Freestanding Pieces of Heart, Small Keys, and Heart Containers (models do not reflect actual items)\n  - Treacherous Tower (Intermediate)\n  - Bee Guy (Golden Bee)\n  - Milk Bar Owner\n- New settings:\n  - `[logic]`\n    - `dont_require_lamp_for_darkness` - By default, Lamp is now required for dark areas (Sanctuary, Graveyard, and Dark Palace). When set to `true`, this is disabled. (Default: `false`)\n    - `require_golden_bee_for_sale` - By default, logic allows for catching a Golden Bee with the Net to get Bee Guy's second item. When set to `true`, only the purchasable Golden Bee is considered in logic. (Default: `false`)\n    - `unsafe_key_placement` - By default, Small Keys in certain dungeons will be filled in order to prevent (most) softlocks. When set to `true`, allows keys to be filled in an order that can result in softlocks. (Default: `false`)\n- Final boss cutscenes are automatically skipped.\n- Some locations and items in spoiler log renamed for consistency.\n- Message in a Bottle and Premium Milk will no longer show up in inventory, but the relevant locations should still be accessible.\n- Fixes:\n  - Fixed receiving Ravio's freebie after purchasing corresponding item.\n  - Zelda can no longer have progression items, other than the Bow of Light.\n  - Obtaining Message in a Bottle while having five bottles no longer causes the message to disappear (or vice-versa).\n  - Excluded locations can no longer contain Bow of Light.","created_at":"2021-05-22T05:26:56.262Z","released_at":"2021-05-22T05:26:56.262Z","upcoming_release":false,"author":{"id":8247112,"username":"marsolk","public_email":"","name":"Kevin Marsolais","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/4fb592336deae2585abe4bc6b9efaacd59ecf69da191d8dccb916aba12ab3062?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/marsol